  "question": {
    "text": "If the sum of the coefficients of all even powers of <math><mi>x</mi></math> in the product <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mn>61</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi></math> then n is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "30",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math><br />Put <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br />Put <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br />From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>61</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>61</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math>"
  }
